  m_text: "The <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>Combat Log</color></font-weight> records
    what happens in the <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>battle</color></font-weight>,
    including <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>effects</color></font-weight> applied
    to <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>characters</color></font-weight>, <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>damage</color></font-weight>
    dealt, <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>healing</color></font-weight> done, <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>cards</color></font-weight>
    used, and <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>character deaths</color></font-weight>.\r\nClicking
    <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>(M1)</color></font-weight> on a character\u2019s
    <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>name</color></font-weight> in the log will immediately
    selects that <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>character</color></font-weight>
    on the <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>battlefield</color></font-weight>.\r\n"
