  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Here you can also view a character\u2019s full stat breakdown, including
    Health, Damage, Initiative, and Movement Points (MP).\n\n\u2022 Health determines
    how much damage a character can take. If a character\u2019s Health reaches 0,
    they are permanently dead. Health can be restored through abilities, cards, or
    in the shop.\n\u2022 Damage represents the character\u2019s base damage value.
    Ability damage multipliers scale from this stat, meaning higher Damage increases
    the effectiveness of offensive abilities.\n\u2022 Initiative determines turn
    order at the start of each round. Characters act from highest to lowest Initiative.
    If Initiative is changed during a round by buffs or debuffs, the turn order updates
    accordingly.\n\u2022 Movement Points (MP) determine how many tiles a character
    can move during their turn.\n\nActive Buffs and Debuffs are displayed in the
    Status Effects section, along with their remaining duration. Hover over a status
    effect to view a tooltip with a detailed explanation of its effects."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6bd24cd4d3d515d48bd7ad1def33fa09, type: 2}
