  m_text: 'The shop offers individual cards, as well as card packs.

    Card packs
    allow you to select two cards from a set of five, offering strategic choice mixed
    with randomness.

    You may also pay to refresh the shop. Refreshing fully
    restocks the shop, replacing all current offerings, including any items you have
    already purchase, with a new random selection of characters, cards, and packs.'
