  m_text: 'The Deck button allows you to view all cards currently in your deck.

    You
    may pay gold to permanently remove cards you no longer want. The cost increases
    each time you remove a card during the same shop visit.

    Removing unwanted
    cards can help focus your deck, making it easier to draw the cards that best
    fit your strategy.'
